tps:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/ECXSZXEH2C637ZQSOACWXFRF.png?width=1280\"},\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/ECXSZXEH2C637ZQSOACWXFRF.png\",\"urls\":{\"320\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/ECXSZXEH2C637ZQSOACWXFRF.png?width=320\",\"640\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/ECXSZXEH2C637ZQSOACWXFRF.png?width=640\",\"80\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/ECXSZXEH2C637ZQSOACWXFRF.png?width=80\",\"2560\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/ECXSZXEH2C637ZQSOACWXFRF.png?width=2560\",\"160\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/ECXSZXEH2C637ZQSOACWXFRF.png?width=160\",\"1280\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/ECXSZXEH2C637ZQSOACWXFRF.png?width=1280\"},\"site_product_image_id\":\"ECXSZXEH2C637ZQSOACWXFRF\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-05-20T13:13:00.403Z\",\"site_id\":\"331421882896289726\",\"width\":2560,\"id\":\"ECXSZXEH2C637ZQSOACWXFRF\",\"height\":2560}},\"placeholder_image\":{\"data\":{\"placeholder\":true,\"url\":\"\\/images\\/commerce\\/store-app\\/app\\/universal_product_placeholder.png\",\"absolute_url\":\"cdn3.editmysite.com\\/images\\/commerce\\/store-app\\/app\\/universal_product_placeholder.png\"}},\"categoryIds\":[\"Q6LUUGWLH23J3DY3ULFHBPOK\"]},{\"id\":\"NPOUCOWQMXS5I553FFA57BNI\",\"owner_id\":\"143854010\",\"merchant_id\":\"MLKB93FPT91XW\",\"site_id\":\"331421882896289726\",\"channel_id\":\"CH_0abDwIQlE19tArq0hghQ3f4FDkJ7AiSj0MtfYRlQuYC\",\"site_product_id\":\"167\",\"square_id\":\"NPOUCOWQMXS5I553FFA57BNI\",\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"visibility_tl\":\"Visible\",\"name\":\"10 Sep | Tovarisch\",\"short_description\":\"<p><br><\\/p><p>Wanting to know more about his father, Stuart Urban discovered an extraordinary life story. But then his father, Garri Urban, had survived the Holocaust and a Soviet Gulag. Stuart, a two-time British Academy award winning director, recorded video diaries over 14 years, which reveal the fate of his family in the Holocaust, and Garri\\u2019s KGB records. To these video diaries he added extensive 16mm Kodachrome home movies, shot from the 1950s onwards, to create the core of this film. The title was taken from Garri\\u2019s autobiography, published in 1980, when he was shot while attempting to swim across an icy river from Soviet-held territory to Romania. Garri told the snipers who lifted his seemingly lifeless body; \\u201cno, tovarisch (comrade), I\\u2019m not dead,\\u201d then proceeded to strike their officer.In 1992, once Communism had collapsed, Stuart followed Garri to the former Soviet Union, where Garri tracked down his KGB file in which he was still listed as an \\u201cinternational spy\\u201d on the wanted list. \\u200bStuart continued to search for answers after his father\\u2019s death, and rather than being a typical biographical documentary, this films questions the concept of identity. The screening will be followed by a Q&amp;A with Stuart Urban.Please note this film includes disturbing content and language that you may find offensive.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>Price includes a glass of wine after the screening<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>Please note that this documentary includes offensive language and disturbing content<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>The film will be followed by a Q&amp;A with the Director Stuart Urban<\\/p>\",\"popularity_score\":0.02,\"cross_sell_product_ids\":[],\"variation_type\":\"3\",\"product_type\":\"event\",\"product_type_details\":{\"location_name\":\"Ognisko Polskie - Polish Hearth\",\"location_types\":[\"IN_PERSON\"],\"address\":{\"city\":\"LONDON\",\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"postal_code\":\"SW7 2PN\",\"region_code\":\"ENG\",\"street\":\"Ognisko Polskie\",\"street2\":\"55 Princ