50:15.617Z\",\"absolute_url\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/5CGLY4RRQJCA66XPZGOY5SUN.jpeg\",\"absolute_urls\":{\"320\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/5CGLY4RRQJCA66XPZGOY5SUN.jpeg?width=320\",\"640\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/5CGLY4RRQJCA66XPZGOY5SUN.jpeg?width=640\",\"80\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/5CGLY4RRQJCA66XPZGOY5SUN.jpeg?width=80\",\"2560\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/5CGLY4RRQJCA66XPZGOY5SUN.jpeg?width=2560\",\"160\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/5CGLY4RRQJCA66XPZGOY5SUN.jpeg?width=160\",\"1280\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/5CGLY4RRQJCA66XPZGOY5SUN.jpeg?width=1280\"},\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/5CGLY4RRQJCA66XPZGOY5SUN.jpeg\",\"urls\":{\"320\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/5CGLY4RRQJCA66XPZGOY5SUN.jpeg?width=320\",\"640\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/5CGLY4RRQJCA66XPZGOY5SUN.jpeg?width=640\",\"80\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/5CGLY4RRQJCA66XPZGOY5SUN.jpeg?width=80\",\"2560\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/5CGLY4RRQJCA66XPZGOY5SUN.jpeg?width=2560\",\"160\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/5CGLY4RRQJCA66XPZGOY5SUN.jpeg?width=160\",\"1280\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/5CGLY4RRQJCA66XPZGOY5SUN.jpeg?width=1280\"},\"site_product_image_id\":\"5CGLY4RRQJCA66XPZGOY5SUN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-20T15:50:15.557Z\",\"site_id\":\"331421882896289726\",\"width\":2560,\"id\":\"5CGLY4RRQJCA66XPZGOY5SUN\",\"height\":2560}},\"placeholder_image\":{\"data\":{\"placeholder\":true,\"url\":\"\\/images\\/commerce\\/store-app\\/app\\/universal_product_placeholder.png\",\"absolute_url\":\"cdn3.editmysite.com\\/images\\/commerce\\/store-app\\/app\\/universal_product_placeholder.png\"}},\"categoryIds\":[\"Q6LUUGWLH23J3DY3ULFHBPOK\"]},{\"id\":\"36VSLGEPOLISUCAYP7N452FV\",\"owner_id\":\"143854010\",\"merchant_id\":\"MLKB93FPT91XW\",\"site_id\":\"331421882896289726\",\"channel_id\":\"CH_0abDwIQlE19tArq0hghQ3f4FDkJ7AiSj0MtfYRlQuYC\",\"site_product_id\":\"36VSLGEPOLISUCAYP7N452FV\",\"square_id\":\"36VSLGEPOLISUCAYP7N452FV\",\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"visibility_tl\":\"Visible\",\"name\":\"5 June |  Antonia Senior in conversation with Roger Moorhouse\",\"short_description\":\"<p><strong>Antonia Senor<\\/strong>\\u00a0<\\/p><p>Antonia is a writer, critic and podcaster. Her novels include The Winter Isles and The Tyrant\\u2019s Shadow. Antonia reviews historical fiction for The Times. Her upcoming book, Stalin\\u2019s Apostles, is a ground-breaking account of the Cambridge Five spy ring. Antonia podcasts at History Book Buffs, and is available to speak or host at bookish events.<\\/p><p><strong>Roger Moorhouse<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Roger Moorhouse studied history and politics at the School of Slavonic and East European Studies of the University of London in the early 1990s, graduating with an MA in 1994. He also studied at the universities of D\\u00fcsseldorf and Strathclyde, and teaches a course on 20th Century Totalitarianism at the College of Europe in Warsaw.<\\/p><p>He began his writing career working for Professor Norman Davies, collaborating with him on many of his publications, including \\u201cEurope: A History\\u201d, \\u201cThe Isles: A History\\u201d, and \\u201cRising \\u201944\\u201d. This working relationship culminated in 2002 with the publication of our co-authored study of the history of the city of Wroc\\u0142aw (the former German Breslau) entitled \\u201cMicrocosm: Portrait of a Central European City\\u201d.<\\/p><p>In 2006, Roger\\u2019s first solo book appeared: \\u201cKilling Hitler\\u201d is an account of the numerous attempts on Hitler\\u2019s life, which sought to place the likes of Georg Elser, Henning von Tresckow and Hans Oster alongside Claus von Stauffenberg in the narrative.<\\/p><p><strong>Stalin\\u2019s Apostles<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Using recently declassified files, \\u201cStalin\\u2019s Apostles\\u201d is an enthralling (and chilling) exploration of the treachery of Donald Maclean, Guy Burgess, Kim Philby, John Cairncross and Keeper of the Queen\\u2019s Pictures Anthony Blunt, all radicalised while at Cambridge University in the 1930s. Thanks to Stalin\\u2019s Cambridge spies there was barely a secret, barely a decision made, that he did not know about, The Five became tools in Stalin\\u2019s imperial scheme, responsible directly and indirectly for the death of thousands of men and women fighting against Soviet domination.<\\/p><p>As \\u201cStalin\\u2019s Apostles\\u201d reveals, they were exposed as much by their own incompetence as by forensic investigation by the CIA, MI5 or MI6. And in time another dictator emerged as ruthless as Stalin, but with an even greater desire to establish a Russian Empire that would threaten Western democracy.\\u00a0<\\/p><p>The legacy of the Cambridge Five is not only in the graveyards of eastern Europe, but at the heart of Putin\\u2019s Kremlin.<\\/p><p>The event will be followed by wine and cocktail snacks<\\/p><p><br><\\/p>\",\"popularity_score\":2,\"cross_sell_product_ids\":[],\"variation_type\":\"3\",\"product_type\":\"event\",\"product_type_details\":{\"location_name\":\"\",\"location_types\":[\"IN_PERSON\"],\"address\":{\"city\":\"London\",\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"postal_code\":\"SW7 2PN\",\"region_code\":\"London\",\"street\":\"55 Exhibition Road\",\"street2\":null,\"region_cod