\"site_product_image_id\":\"MLTZYJCWAAY75PM5SD4BBMLS\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-06-22T09:48:00.342Z\",\"site_id\":\"331421882896289726\",\"width\":2560,\"id\":\"MLTZYJCWAAY75PM5SD4BBMLS\",\"height\":2560}},\"placeholder_image\":{\"data\":{\"placeholder\":true,\"url\":\"\\/images\\/commerce\\/store-app\\/app\\/universal_product_placeholder.png\",\"absolute_url\":\"cdn3.editmysite.com\\/images\\/commerce\\/store-app\\/app\\/universal_product_placeholder.png\"}},\"categoryIds\":[]},{\"id\":\"F3QR74DKIUSY7PV5ZL2DVSPR\",\"owner_id\":\"143854010\",\"merchant_id\":\"MLKB93FPT91XW\",\"site_id\":\"331421882896289726\",\"channel_id\":\"CH_0abDwIQlE19tArq0hghQ3f4FDkJ7AiSj0MtfYRlQuYC\",\"site_product_id\":\"F3QR74DKIUSY7PV5ZL2DVSPR\",\"square_id\":\"F3QR74DKIUSY7PV5ZL2DVSPR\",\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"visibility_tl\":\"Visible\",\"name\":\"6 July - July Musical Moments\",\"short_description\":\"<p>A guitar can produce great musical and emotional range, and a guitar duo can definitely achieve twice as much !  We would like to inform you of a change to the line up for Musical Moments on July 6th. This was due to be a guitar duo featuring Leo Gaizauskas and Harold Gordon-Smith. The concert will now be performed by Harold, as Leo is unfortunately no longer able to join us. If you would like any further information please contact the office.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>The \\u2018Musical Moments\\u2019 concerts have been made possible by the very kind cooperation of The Trinity Laban Conservatoire of Music and Dance. We are very privileged in being able to present these young, highly talented musicians who are already making their mark in the music world.<\\/p>\",\"popularity_score\":0.9,\"cross_sell_product_ids\":[],\"variation_type\":\"3\",\"product_type\":\"event\",\"product_type_details\":{\"end_date\":\"2026-07-06\",\"start_time\":\"7:00 PM\",\"location_name\":\"\",\"address\":{\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"country_code_full_name\":\"United Kingdom\",\"city\":\"LONDON\",\"street\":\"Ognis