",\"80\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/DLU2FRMJPLBXBTTG74254MTS.jpeg?width=80\",\"2560\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/DLU2FRMJPLBXBTTG74254MTS.jpeg?width=2560\",\"160\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/DLU2FRMJPLBXBTTG74254MTS.jpeg?width=160\",\"1280\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/DLU2FRMJPLBXBTTG74254MTS.jpeg?width=1280\"},\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/DLU2FRMJPLBXBTTG74254MTS.jpeg\",\"urls\":{\"320\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/DLU2FRMJPLBXBTTG74254MTS.jpeg?width=320\",\"640\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/DLU2FRMJPLBXBTTG74254MTS.jpeg?width=640\",\"80\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/DLU2FRMJPLBXBTTG74254MTS.jpeg?width=80\",\"2560\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/DLU2FRMJPLBXBTTG74254MTS.jpeg?width=2560\",\"160\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/DLU2FRMJPLBXBTTG74254MTS.jpeg?width=160\",\"1280\":\"https:\\/\\/143854010.cdn6.editmysite.com\\/uploads\\/1\\/4\\/3\\/8\\/143854010\\/DLU2FRMJPLBXBTTG74254MTS.jpeg?width=1280\"},\"site_product_image_id\":\"DLU2FRMJPLBXBTTG74254MTS\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-06-10T11:13:58.416Z\",\"site_id\":\"331421882896289726\",\"width\":2560,\"id\":\"DLU2FRMJPLBXBTTG74254MTS\",\"height\":2560}},\"placeholder_image\":{\"data\":{\"placeholder\":true,\"url\":\"\\/images\\/commerce\\/store-app\\/app\\/universal_product_placeholder.png\",\"absolute_url\":\"cdn3.editmysite.com\\/images\\/commerce\\/store-app\\/app\\/universal_product_placeholder.png\"}},\"categoryIds\":[\"VB5BTC3FXXCEZZPYS6AJIDKL\"]},{\"id\":\"I2STRTKP45J6XAMQE7SQ7QWT\",\"owner_id\":\"143854010\",\"merchant_id\":\"MLKB93FPT91XW\",\"site_id\":\"331421882896289726\",\"channel_id\":\"CH_0abDwIQlE19tArq0hghQ3f4FDkJ7AiSj0MtfYRlQuYC\",\"site_product_id\":\"I2STRTKP45J6XAMQE7SQ7QWT\",\"square_id\":\"I2STRTKP45J6XAMQE7SQ7QWT\",\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"visibility_tl\":\"Visible\",\"name\":\"26 Feb | \\u201cNot There\\u201d An evening with Mariusz Szczygie\\u0142\",\"short_description\":\"<p>Mariusz Szczygie\\u0142,<strong>\\u00a0<\\/strong>one of Europe\\u2019s most celebrated journalists,\\u00a0explores themes of loss, grief, absence and acceptance in his new book\\u00a0<strong>Not There<em>. <\\/em><\\/strong>This collection of essays and reportage was inspired by\\u00a0\\u00a0conversations Mariusz had with various people: a Czech poet, a Ukrainian soldier, a retired Polish accountant, a Hungarian antique shop owner, an Albanian painter and also the author\\u2019s elderly father. These conversations initially discuss the idea of absence and the way humans face it, then \\u00a0evolve\\u00a0to cover other fascinating concepts,\\u00a0including the uncertainty of memory, and how our idea of the truth can be very subjective.\\u00a0<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>Mariusz will be appearing in conversation with Antonia Lloyd-Jones, the award-winning\\u00a0translater of this book, as well as Polish fiction, non-fiction, poetry and children\\u2019s books. Her translation of\\u00a0<em>Drive Your Plow Over the Bones of the Dead\\u00a0<\\/em>by 2018 Nobel Prize laureate Olga Tokarczuk was shortlisted for the 2019 Man Booker International Prize.\\u00a0<\\/p><p>This event is kindly sponsored by the Polish Cultural Institute.\\u00a0<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>The event will be followed by wine and cocktail snacks<\\/p><p><br><\\/p>\",\"popularity_score\":0.02,\"cross_sell_product_ids\":[],\"variation_type\":\"3\",\"product_type\":\"event\",\"product_type_details\":{\"end_date\":\"2026-02-26\",\"start_time\":\"7:00 PM\",\"location_name\":\