ges\\/commerce\\/store-app\\/app\\/universal_product_placeholder.png\",\"absolute_url\":\"cdn3.editmysite.com\\/images\\/commerce\\/store-app\\/app\\/universal_product_placeholder.png\"}},\"categoryIds\":[\"VB5BTC3FXXCEZZPYS6AJIDKL\"]},{\"id\":\"W7HJETQSPP6GYDYCUWM36AXP\",\"owner_id\":\"143854010\",\"merchant_id\":\"MLKB93FPT91XW\",\"site_id\":\"331421882896289726\",\"channel_id\":\"CH_0abDwIQlE19tArq0hghQ3f4FDkJ7AiSj0MtfYRlQuYC\",\"site_product_id\":\"W7HJETQSPP6GYDYCUWM36AXP\",\"square_id\":\"W7HJETQSPP6GYDYCUWM36AXP\",\"visibility\":\"visible\",\"visibility_tl\":\"Visible\",\"name\":\"11 Oct |  KinoKlub - Kamerdyner (The Butler)\",\"short_description\":\"<p><strong>KinoKlub - Kamerdyner (The Butler)<\\/strong><\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>Saturday, 11th October, 2026<\\/p><p>7pm for 7.30pm<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>Price: \\u00a315|Ognisko Polskie Members \\u00a310<\\/p><p>Includes a glass of wine and cocktail snacks after the screening<\\/p><p><br><\\/p><p>Kamerdyner (The Butler) tells the story of a Prussian family, von Kraus, living in the Puck area between 1900 and 1945, when conflict between Germans, Poles and Kashubians frequently escalated. The love between a Kashubian and a German aristocrat illuminates the choices people had to make.<\\/p><p>KinoKlub showcases recent Polish films in the Club\\u2019s Ballroom. A pre-film two-course meal is available at 6pm in Ognisko Restaurant at \\u00a325 per person, which must be booked in advance through the club office.<\\/p><p><br><\\/p>\",\"popularity_score\":0,\"cross_sell_product_ids\":[],\"variation_type\":\"3\",\"product_type\":\"event\",\"product_type_details\":{\"location_name\":\"Ognisko Polskie \",\"location_types\":[\"IN_PERSON\"],\"address\":{\"city\":\"London\",\"country_code\":\"GB\",\"postal_code\":\"SW7 2PN\",\"region_code\":\"London\",\"street\":\"55 Exhibition Road\",\"street2\":null,\"region_code_cca2\":\"London\",\"region_code_full_name\":\"London\",\"country_code_cca2\":\"GB\",\"country_code_full_name\":\"Uni